`3-Project-Design`
EduGenie: Google Gemini-Powered Learning Assistant
Project Design
1. System Design Overview
EduGenie is designed as a web-based AI learning platform that connects students with a Google Gemini-powered virtual tutor. The system follows a modular architecture so that each learning function can be developed and maintained independently.
The overall system consists of:
• User Interface
• Application/Backend Layer
• Gemini AI Service
• Database
• File Storage
• Authentication
• Learning Analytics
